Template: homelab-ai/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host to bootstrap this app's roles/schema on:
 Used only once, at first install, to run homelab-bootstrap-app-role.

Template: homelab-ai/pgbouncer_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PgBouncer host to register this app's runtime role with:

Template: homelab-ai/api_base
Type: string
Default: http://localhost:3000
Description: Base URL where homelab-api is reachable (for the service registry):

Template: homelab-ai/listen_port
Type: string
Default: 2521
Description: Port for homelab-ai to listen on:

Template: homelab-ai/advertise_host
Type: string
Default: 127.0.0.1
Description: This host's own address to advertise in the service registry:

Template: homelab-ai/api_key
Type: password
Description: The Anthropic API key:
 Kept only in /etc/homelab/ai/config.yml (0640 root:homelab). Leave blank
 to install without one and add it to the config afterwards.
